<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [463].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>463&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SALTWATER MEDIUM WITH ACETATE AND FERRIC CITRATE</FONT></B></P>
Use JCM Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=462">462</a> without Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O, and with 20 mM sodium acetate and 30 mM ferric citrate instead of sodium lactate. Reduce the medium with 0.5 g/L L-cysteine&#183;HCl (5% solution, autoclaved and stored under N<sub>2</sub>).       <br>
